WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.080
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.410
No being weird and gross in the bathroom!

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.459
Don't even start, we're not going there.

00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:14.809
But recently Dr. Bright has adopted a habit
of eating his lunches in the bathroom, like

00:00:14.809 --> 00:00:18.040
the sad lonely protagonist of a high school
coming-of-age movie.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.970
You're not struggling to find a clique to
fit in with, you're an adult.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.790
Even though you're technically immortal, it's
not a good idea to risk food-borne illness

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.400
by bringing food into the bathroom.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.400
Stop it!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.010
It's weird and gross!Eat in the canteen or
eat in your office!

